```typescript
// Before
let products: any[] = [];
catch (err: any) { console.error(err.message); }

// After  
let products: ChatProduct[] = [];
catch (err) { 
  const error = err as Error;
  console.error(error.message); 
}
```

- Fixed empty interfaces by converting to type aliases (`CommandDialogProps`, `TextareaProps`)
- Suppressed unavoidable CommonJS require in Tailwind config

**React Best Practices (15 warnings)**
- Suppressed intentional exhaustive-deps in 4 files (WebGL animation loop, realtime subscriptions)
- Suppressed component export warnings for utility functions/hooks that must coexist with components

